/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * A real Inara SLEF export of an engineered passenger Lynx Highliner (27 `Modules` entries).
 *
 * Contributed 2026-08-05 UTC by the repository owner from their own commander's fleet. Manual
 * correction: the header was reduced to `appName` and `appVersion`, dropping the `appURL`
 * commander-fleet link and the `appCustomProperties` Inara commander and ship ids — a person's
 * account. Nothing under `data` was touched, and the build is otherwise stored as received apart
 * from re-indenting. Stored-form SHA-256
 * `a213d4219fa9531224aafc185d399b08896f7c7ed0a7461b0c8dd0a822767651` (of the scrubbed file, since
 * that is what a port must reproduce).
 *
 * It is the ground truth for the passenger restriction: `passenger01`–`passenger03` hold Mk II
 * passenger cabins, which EDSY's reservation alone could not confirm, and three more cabins sit in
 * unrestricted mounts, so the restriction runs one way only.
 *
 * The capture is Elite Dangerous game output and remains the property of Frontier Developments
 * plc, redistributed under Frontier's media-usage terms; see ATTRIBUTIONS.md.
 *
 * A stored checksum here is of the payload alone, taken with this header comment removed; a source
 * checksum is of the upstream file as it was received.
 */
